#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:5
msgid "Rotate object"
msgstr "旋转对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows choosing the orientation from many object which are "
"represented at the `folio`_. The objects which orientation can be chosen are"
" the following:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许从在 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 中代表的许多对象中选择方向。 可以选择方向的对象如下："

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:10
msgid "`Element`_"
msgstr "`元件 <Element_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:11
msgid "`Picture`_"
msgstr "`平面 <Picture_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:12
msgid "`Text field`_"
msgstr "`文本字段 <Text field_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:14
msgid ""
"QElectroTech does not allow all orientations for the objects mentioned "
"before, only 4 different orientations are possible: **0**, **90**, **180** "
"and **270** degrees."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech不允许前述对象的所有方向，只有4个不同的方向是可能的：**0**,**90**,**180** 和 **270** 度。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:19
msgid ""
"QElectroTech only offers the possibility to rotate **90** degrees on the "
"clock direction."
msgstr "QElectroTech只提供在时钟方向旋转 **90** 度的可能性。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:21
msgid "To rotate **180** degrees the actions should be repeated once."
msgstr "要旋转 **180** 度，动作应该重复一次 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:22
msgid "To rotate **270** degrees the actions should be repeated twice."
msgstr "要旋转 **270** 度，动作应该重复两次 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:26
msgid ""
"Multiples objects can be rotated at the same time `selecting multiples "
"object`_"
msgstr "多个对象可以同时旋转 `选择多个对象 <selecting multiples object_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:28
msgid ""
"Rotating objects can be done from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_, by right click on"
" the object and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "旋转对象可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中通过右键点击对象并使用相应的键盘快捷键完成。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:32
msgid "Rotate object from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏旋转对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:34
#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:45
#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:70
msgid "`Select the object`_ which should be rotated."
msgstr "`选择应当旋转的对象 <Select the object_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:35
msgid "Select **Edit > Rotate** menu item to rotate the object."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 旋转** 菜单项来旋转对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:40
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:43
msgid "Rotate object from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏旋转对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:46
msgid ""
"Select the icon |transform-rotate| from `toolbar`_ to rotate the object."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |transform-rotate| 来旋转对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:48
msgid "transform-rotate"
msgstr "变换旋转"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:52
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:55
msgid "Rotate object by right click"
msgstr "右键旋转对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:57
msgid "Right click on the object which should be rotated."
msgstr "右键单击应旋转的对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:58
msgid "Select the option **Rotate** to delete the object."
msgstr "选择 **旋转** 删除对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:63
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech right click PopUP window"
msgstr "图：右键点击 PopUP 窗口的QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:66
msgid "Rotate object using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键旋转对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:68
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:71
msgid "Press ``Space`` to rotate the object."
msgstr "按 ``Space`` 旋转对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/rotate.rst:75
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
